

Gahunda sukura.


>> Veggy := Ikintu gishya.
Veggy bigeze: ['gishya'] kora: {
	>> v := ubwacyo gishya.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy bigeze: ['init'] kora: { icyacyo veggies := 0. }.

Veggy bigeze: ['carrots:'] kora: { :a icyacyo veggies := a. <- Ntacyo. }.
Veggy bigeze: ['carrots'] kora: { <- icyacyo veggies. }.
Veggy bigeze: ['+'] kora: { :f
	>> n := Veggy gishya.
	n carrots: (f carrots + icyacyo veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy bigeze: ['inyandiko'] kora: { <- icyacyo veggies inyandiko.
}.

Umubare bigeze: ['carrots'] kora: {
	>> x := Veggy gishya.
	x carrots: ubwacyo. <- x.
}.

Umubare bigeze: ['add:and:'] kora: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Ibisohoka andika: q, umurongo-mushya.
